# Keep `railway up` uploads under the size limit.
#
# The vendored SPP SDK fork (vendor/stellar-private-payments) is ~110MB of
# Rust workspace + build artifacts, but deployed services only need the npm
# package the app installs as a file: dependency —
# vendor/stellar-private-payments/sdk/web (package.json + js/ + dist/).
# Everything else in the vendor tree is reference source for humans and the
# local wasm rebuild, never read by a Railway build.
vendor/stellar-private-payments/*
!vendor/stellar-private-payments/sdk
vendor/stellar-private-payments/sdk/*
!vendor/stellar-private-payments/sdk/web
!vendor/stellar-private-payments/UPSTREAM.md

# Gitignored anyway, but be explicit: never upload the reference clones or
# the Rust target cache (vendor/*/target is a symlink into resources/).
resources/
vendor/stellar-private-payments/target
